[break] a-link-is-resolved-by-its-shown-name
rule: list resolves a link by its path as it is, not as it is shown.
file: crates/cortex-tools/src/list.rs
find: let path = walk::joined_path(data, entry.relative);
replace: let path = line.clone();
caught-by:
    cortex-tools::it list::a_name_that_acts_unseen_is_listed_as_an_escape_and_a_link_of_such_a_name_resolves

[break] a-matching-line-is-shown-as-it-is
rule: search shows a matching line with every character that would act unseen as an escape, its tabs kept.
